WEBVTT

00:05:59.405 --> 00:06:01.381
You might want to use the stairs, there.

00:06:01.405 --> 00:06:03.977
(Applause)

00:06:04.001 --> 00:06:06.302
It's very important
for everybody here to realize

00:06:06.326 --> 00:06:08.076
I haven't set anything up with you.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.974
You don't know what will happen, right?

00:06:09.998 --> 00:06:12.475
Would you mind just standing
over here for a moment?

00:06:12.499 --> 00:06:13.893
Your name is?
Nicole: Nicole.

00:06:13.917 --> 00:06:14.924
KB: Nicole, and?

00:06:14.948 --> 00:06:15.957
(Telephone ringing)

00:06:15.981 --> 00:06:19.913
KB: Actually, here's the thing,
answer it, answer it, answer it.

00:06:19.937 --> 00:06:20.976
(Laughter)

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.976
Is it a girl?
Man: They've already gone.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.350
KB: OK, swap over positions.

00:06:24.374 --> 00:06:26.976
Can you stand over here?
This will make it easier.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.576
Pity, I would have told them
it was the ace of spades.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.745
OK, a little bit closer.